No, you don't get experience. If you can take the monsters easily, I'd 
say kill 'em yourself. But you could wear the ring and fight anyway, and 
you'll still probably end up with most of the experience.

Around clvl 14 or so, it starts getting REALLY hard to level through 
kills alone (KPD - I know you can). So while you can probably get to 14 
without other means, you shouldn't really be thinking of kills as the 
way to gain levels after about that point. My suggestion would be 
foocubi if you have high int/wis (blessed !oEnlightenment) and cha 
(sitting on magic traps).

